# The dusk gradient behind everything. 64x600: tall enough to cover the
# viewport at 1:1 so it never repeats vertically, and uniform horizontally so
# it tiles for free as the camera pans.
#
# The seams between bands are ordered dithers rather than hard edges. Four
# colours cannot make a smooth sky on their own, and adding more would have
# meant four palette entries that exist only to be blended — the dither buys
# the same result out of colours the rest of the game already uses.
name platformer-sky
size 64 600
key a dusk-0-far
key b dusk-1
key c dusk-2
key d dusk-3-glow
pixels
